
    Why would you want to register Vote?

    ----------------------------------------------------------------

    1.  There will be no more bug fixes for Vote 1.0 Unregistered!
        (There will be for Registered versions)

    2.  Registered shows WHO wrote the poll when a user votes.

    3.  Registered has a configurable Bad-User lockout option that will:

            1.  Either make a mock syntax error and quit,
            2.  or just outright say "You have been locked out."

    4.  Voting Poll handling:

            You can configure it if you wish to handle polls in a certain
            way if you get up to a certain number of polls, when you get
            to the number you specify it will do 1 of three things you
            choose:
                    1.  Tell the user the booth is full and he cannot post.
                    2.  Delete all the polls and start over.
                    3.  Delete the oldest poll to make room for the new!

    5.  There are already big bug fixes to the Registered Version.

    6.  If I don't start getting a little bit of an income.. my board goes
        *SPLAT* and I can't write anymore. :(

